    "gitCommitMessage": "Sleek lesson layout, clean mascots, smooth full-range piano audio\n\nLayout: derive the keyboard height from the space left after the top bar,\nteacher row, and controls (cap 180, down from 230) and bottom-anchor it, so\nthe keys no longer overlap the REPLAY/CONTINUE buttons. Slim the lesson\nmascot to a 68px avatar.\n\nMascot art: strip the stray sliver bleeding in from the neighbouring sticker\nabove each cutout (the fragment that showed over the penguin's head). Removes\nonly components lying entirely above the main figure, so hats/batons/sheet\nmusic stay intact. 12 mascots cleaned.\n\nAudio: regenerate the piano sample set and extend it from C6 up to C7 so every\nkey on the C2..B6 keyboard has a correctly-pitched sample — fixing the silence\nabove C5/C6 (notes there previously had no sample and clamped an octave down).\nUpper octaves use fewer partials, gentler brightness, and a soft volume taper\nso the high register is smooth and lovely instead of harsh. Mid/low timbre is\nunchanged. Adds scripts/gen_piano_samples.py and widens the sample map to\nMIDI 36..96.",
